ard of tower defense strategy games, and the VR version is one of the most comfortable VR games you can purchase while giving you a physical sense of the action around you that really enhances your strategic awareness of the game. Defense Grid 2 supports the Gear VR Controller, standard headset controls, or a Bluetooth Gamepad so you can play the way you want to play.", "short_description": "Defense Grid 2\u2019s amazing tower-defense strategy gameplay comes to Gear VR and the Gear VR Controller! It is \u201cFree to Try\u201d with plenty of initial content and only a single purchase to unlock everything else. DG2 pushes premium mobile VR gaming to its limits."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.hiddenpath.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://www.hiddenpath.com/terms-of-use/", "publisher_name": "Hidden Path Entertainment", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.hiddenpath.com/game/defense-grid-2-enhanced-vr-edition/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": null, "genres": ["STRATEGY"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "fr", "de", "ko", "es"], "supported_input_devices": ["GAMEPAD", "TOUCHPAD", "GEAR_VR_CONTROLLER"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "4840478422688491"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 18, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "567115243701832"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2124096017889941"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "185089628872977"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "720716744995439"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1348212861962948"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "549750808790487"}, {"stat